bb_paragraph\" >You might not be the smartest fighter Mliuej has seen\u2026 but you\u2019ll definitely be the bravest and you might just become the greatest brawler the taverns have ever known!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/ec37061e37d3a885764498832057e82f.poster.avif?t=1751371185\" width=800 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/ec37061e37d3a885764498832057e82f.webm?t=1751371185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/ec37061e37d3a885764498832057e82f.mp4?t=1751371185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMING SOON\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW, PUNCH FACES LATER</strong></p>",
